.TH TRANSUME 1 "September 2026" "Transume 1.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
transume \- graphical interface for Clonezilla workflows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B transume
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Transume
provides guided GTK4 workflows for disk and partition backup, restore, direct
cloning, image verification, storage connections, and read-only image
exploration on Debian 13 and MiniOS.
.PP
Local, removable, SMB, NFS, and SSH repositories are supported. LVM2 whole-disk
backup and restore use Clonezilla's native PV, VG, and LV workflow. Partition
restore preserves existing disk-wide partition and boot metadata.
.PP
The graphical application runs without root privileges. It requests PolicyKit
authorization only when mounting storage or starting privileged work.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/transume
Per-user activity history, redacted logs, and image catalog state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR transume-cli (1),
.BR clonezilla (1),
.BR partclone (8)
